# Environment files — NEVER commit these.
# Previously only `.env.local` was ignored, so a plain `.env` holding the real
# BOT_TOKEN / OAUTH2_CLIENT_SECRET / GEETEST_KEY would have been committed by
# `git add -A`. Only `.env.example` (placeholders) is allowed through.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log
dist/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
